AltoRewardsDistributor::submitNewPendingRoot
├── when caller is not merkle root updater or owner
│   └── it should revert
├── when new merkle root equals current pending root
│   └── it should revert
├── when new merkle root is zero (and current pending is also zero)
│   └── it should revert with AlreadyPending
└── when caller is authorized and inputs are valid
    ├── when updater submits root
    │   ├── it should set pending merkle root
    │   ├── it should set validFrom timestamp with timelock
    │   └── it should emit SubmitPendingMerkleRoot event
    └── when owner submits root
        ├── it should set pending merkle root
        ├── it should set validFrom timestamp with timelock
        └── it should emit SubmitPendingMerkleRoot event
